      "explanation": "A signed-in user can change rows that belong to other users in the table \"notes\".",
      "fix": "Add a row security policy on \"notes\" so a user can only change rows where \"owner_id\" equals their own user id (auth.uid()). Check the update policy for a condition that is always true.",
